"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit 会下载官方 Electron 41.10.7（Apple 芯片版为 113 MiB，Intel 版为 119 MiB；解压后的内容分别约为 275 MiB 和 303 MiB）。ZIP 文件和 Electron 可执行文件在使用前均会经过 SHA-256 验证。Biscuit 会在私有文件夹中保留完整的官方运行时内容及其 LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html 许可声明。不会进行全局安装；个人浏览器配置文件、Codex 和共享运行时均不会受到影响。Electron 的沙盒和操作系统保护仍保持启用。";
